  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/39d5d53fbef7cb246c82384c70b63b0287aa26f6cdb11ad3d427215025057797.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n(12-[(3-5) × 4] ÷ 8-8+[6 ÷(12 × 2)])/(9 × 15 ÷(12 × 10)-[12 ÷(6 × 2)])\n\n⇒ (12-[(3-5) × 4] ÷ 8-8+[6 ÷24])/(9 × 15 ÷(12 × 10)-[12 ÷12])\n\n⇒ (12-[(3-5) × 4] ÷ 8-8+1/4)/(9 × 15 ÷(12 × 10)-1)\n\n⇒ (12-[-2 × 4] ÷ 8-8+1/4)/(9 × 15 ÷120-1)\n\n⇒ (12-[-8] ÷ 8-8+1/4)/(9 × 1/8-1)\n\n⇒ (12- [-1]-8+1/4)/(9 /8-1)\n\n⇒ (13-8+1/4)/(9 /8-1)\n\n⇒ (5+1/4)/(9 /8-1)\n\n⇒ ((20+1)/4)/((9 -8)/8)\n\n⇒ (21/4)/(1/8)\n\n⇒ 21/4 × 8/1\n\n⇒ (21 × 2)\n\n⇒ 42\n\n**∴ The required value is 42**\n\n1d0:Tb3f,\n\n<st",
